  "description": "Yu-Jeong, abandoned once by her birth parents and twice by her adoptive parents. Ji-Woon, unable to believe in love because of the many mothers who left him. Two people who never knew their mothers become a legal couple for the sake of the precious child they want to protect. The story of how they start as a couple on paper and become a real family.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
